{"id":2290,"date":"2024-11-19T23:50:01","date_gmt":"2024-11-19T15:50:01","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2290"},"modified":"2024-12-08T10:12:46","modified_gmt":"2024-12-08T02:12:46","slug":"pleated-filter-bags","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=pleated-filter-bags","title":{"rendered":"Pleated Filter Bags"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"product-post\" data-elementor-id=\"2290\" class=\"elementor elementor-2290\" data-elementor-post-type=\"product\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-68c2d1d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"68c2d1d\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-92165e1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"92165e1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Ordinary bag-type dust collectors cannot meet the environmental protection requirements and must be modified to reduce the wind speed and increase the filter area of the dust collectors so as to meet the required emission standards. Pleated filter bag, also called star filter bag, is a new type of dust filter bag that can be applied to pulse bag filter. And there is a supporting dust removal framework. It is a cost-effective filtration solution that can significantly reduce costs and solve bag house capacity problems.<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-size: 14px;\">An innovative product from Filmedia\u00ae, the unique pleat design of the pleated filter bag doubles the usable fabric filter area in the same space compared to conventional cylindrical and oval filter bags. The pleats are gathered at snap-on straps at the top of the filter bag, so the pleated filter bag fits into the same cell plate holes as a standard bag of the same diameter. Horizontal bands sewn into the fabric ensure that the pleats are retained throughout its service life.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-feb7124 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"feb7124\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-99ad212 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"99ad212\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Pleated-Filter-Bags-04-\u8be6\u60c51_syy.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2280\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Pleated-Filter-Bags-04-\u8be6\u60c51_syy.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Pleated-Filter-Bags-04-\u8be6\u60c51_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Pleated-Filter-Bags-04-\u8be6\u60c51_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Pleated-Filter-Bags-04-\u8be6\u60c51_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5006d32 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"5006d32\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Pleated-Filter-Bags-02-\u8be6\u60c52_syy.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2281\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter